      "Process Variables & Composition Measures: Mass fraction $w_i = \\frac{m_i}{m_{total}}$ and mole fraction $x_i = \\frac{n_i}{n_{total}}$; Parts per million (ppm) and parts per billion (ppb); Molarity (mol/L), Molality (mol/kg solvent), Normality (eq/L).",
